## Model card

- **Name:** Qwen 3.7 Plus
- **Short description:** Alibaba’s Qwen 3.7 Plus is described in local metadata as a GUI-agent/coding tier model on the Qwen Max backbone with large context and hosted pricing tiers.
- **Provider / access:** Alibaba Cloud / Qwen hosted surfaces (per local metadata). Local metadata lists `opencode/qwen-3.7-plus` and `noFreeId`.
- **Release / knowledge:** Release and knowledge cutoff not independently verified from accessible official public sources in this pass.
- **IDs:** `qwen-3.7-plus`.
- **Context window:** 1,000,000 (1M); 131K out (local metadata).
- **Modalities:** Text, image input; text output (local metadata).
- **Pricing (as of 2026-11-10):** Tiered pricing listed in local metadata (e.g. $0.40/$1.60 per 1M <=256K input, higher above 256K, reseller variants); not independently verified from accessible official pricing pages in this pass.
- **Architecture:** Not independently verified in this pass.

